[
  {"comment": "Sweep (F3) with the volumes of the T0 models (sweep_*). Sketch1 (F1) on XY: the path of sweep_path, a line (0,0)-(40,0) (c1), a quarter of radius 20 about (40,20) on to (60,20) and a line up to (60,60): 80 + 10 pi long."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_line", "sketch": "F1", "start": [0, 0], "end": [40, 0]},
  {"cmd": "sketch.arc", "sketch": "F1", "mode": "center", "center": [40, 20], "start": "p3", "end": [60, 20]},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_line", "sketch": "F1", "start": [60, 20], "end": [60, 60]},
  {"comment": "Sketch2 (F2) on YZ: a 10 mm circle at the origin, region r{c1}."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create", "plane": "yz"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_circle", "sketch": "F2", "center": [0, 0], "diameter": 10},

  {"comment": "sweep_path: V = pi 5^2 (80 + 10 pi) (Pappus), the path chained from its first line (Sweep1, F3). The start cap is at the profile."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "sweep", "profiles": [{"sketch": "F2", "region": "r{c1}"}],
    "path": {"sketch": "F1", "curves": ["c1"], "chain": true}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Sweep1", "status": "ok", "body": "F3.b0", "volume": 8750.586407451927, "tolerance": 1e-4,
    "has_face": "F3:start(r{c1})"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F3.b0", "has_face": "F3:end(r{c1})", "min": [0, -5, -5], "max": [65, 60, 5], "tolerance": 1e-3}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F3.b0", "has_face": "F3:side(c1)"}},
  {"comment": "Half of the path (distanceOne 0.5): half the volume."},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F3", "def": {"type": "sweep", "profiles": [{"sketch": "F2", "region": "r{c1}"}],
    "path": {"sketch": "F1", "curves": ["c1"], "chain": true},
    "extent": {"type": "partial", "fraction": 0.5}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F3.b0", "volume": 4375.293203725963, "tolerance": 1e-4}},

  {"comment": "sweep_twist: a 10 mm square on YZ (Sketch4, F5) along 50 mm of the X axis (Sketch3, F4) turned 90 degrees keeps its area: V = 10 * 10 * 50 (Sweep2, F6)."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_line", "sketch": "F4", "start": [0, 0], "end": [50, 0]},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create", "plane": "yz"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_rectangle", "sketch": "F5", "corner": [-5, -5], "width": 10, "height": 10},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "sweep",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F5", "region": "r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}"}],
    "path": {"sketch": "F4", "curves": ["c1"]}, "twist_angle": "90 deg", "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Sweep2", "status": "ok", "body": "F6.b0", "volume": 5000, "tolerance": 1e-5,
    "has_face": "F6:side(c1[c4,c2])"}},

  {"comment": "sweep_guide_rail: the circle along the X axis, the rail (0,5)-(50,10) (Sketch5, F7) scales it into a frustum, V = pi 50 / 3 (5^2 + 5 * 10 + 10^2) (Sweep3, F8)."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_line", "sketch": "F7", "start": [0, 5], "end": [50, 10]},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "sweep", "profiles": [{"sketch": "F2", "region": "r{c1}"}],
    "path": {"sketch": "F4", "curves": ["c1"]}, "guide_rail": {"sketch": "F7", "curves": ["c1"]},
    "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Sweep3", "status": "ok", "body": "F8.b0", "volume": 9162.97857297023, "tolerance": 1e-5}},
  {"comment": "The rail's point where it crosses the plane square to the path (mitcad#469): the same along this straight rail."},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F8", "def": {"type": "sweep", "profiles": [{"sketch": "F2", "region": "r{c1}"}],
    "path": {"sketch": "F4", "curves": ["c1"]}, "guide_rail": {"sketch": "F7", "curves": ["c1"]},
    "rail_point": "plane", "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Sweep3", "status": "ok", "body": "F8.b0", "volume": 9162.97857297023, "tolerance": 1e-5}},
  {"comment": "Without scaling the rail only turns the circle: a cylinder."},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F8", "def": {"type": "sweep", "profiles": [{"sketch": "F2", "region": "r{c1}"}],
    "path": {"sketch": "F4", "curves": ["c1"]}, "guide_rail": {"sketch": "F7", "curves": ["c1"]},
    "profile_scaling": "none", "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F8.b0", "volume": 3926.990816987241, "tolerance": 1e-4}},

  {"comment": "Operations: a 50 x 20 x 20 block (Sketch6 F9, Extrude1 F10) along the X axis, cut by the circle swept along it (Sweep4, F11): 20000 - 25 pi 50."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_rectangle", "sketch": "F9", "corner": [0, -10], "width": 50, "height": 20},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F9", "region": "r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}"}],
    "extent": {"type": "symmetric", "distance": 10}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "sweep", "profiles": [{"sketch": "F2", "region": "r{c1}"}],
    "path": {"sketch": "F4", "curves": ["c1"]}, "operation": "cut", "participants": ["F10.b0"]}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Sweep4", "status": "ok", "body": "F10.b0", "volume": 16073.009183012759, "tolerance": 1e-4,
    "has_face": "F11:side(c1)"}},
  {"comment": "Intersected instead, only the swept circle is left of the block."},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F11", "def": {"type": "sweep", "profiles": [{"sketch": "F2", "region": "r{c1}"}],
    "path": {"sketch": "F4", "curves": ["c1"]}, "operation": "intersect", "participants": ["F10.b0"]}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F10.b0", "volume": 3926.990816987241, "tolerance": 1e-4}},
  {"comment": "Parallel along the straight path is the same as perpendicular; flipped, the path runs from x = 50 back, the profile still at x = 0 and the sweep the same."},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F11", "def": {"type": "sweep", "profiles": [{"sketch": "F2", "region": "r{c1}"}],
    "path": {"sketch": "F4", "curves": ["c1"]}, "orientation": "parallel", "flip": true,
    "operation": "join", "participants": ["F10.b0"]}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Sweep4", "status": "ok", "body": "F10.b0", "volume": 20000, "tolerance": 1e-6}},

  {"comment": "Guide surfaces (mitcad#157): a cylinder of radius 10 about the X axis (Sketch7 F12 on YZ, Extrude2 F13, 40 long), a path along it at y = 10 (Sketch8 F14), a 2 x 2 square beside it (Sketch9 F15 on YZ, y = 10..12, z = -1..1) swept along the path guided by the cylinder (Sweep5, F16): V = 4 * 40; the twist does not apply."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create", "plane": "yz"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_circle", "sketch": "F12", "center": [0, 0], "diameter": 20},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude", "profiles": [{"sketch": "F12", "region": "r{c1}"}],
    "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 40}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_line", "sketch": "F14", "start": [0, 10], "end": [40, 10]},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create", "plane": "yz"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_rectangle", "sketch": "F15", "corner": [-1, 10], "width": 2, "height": 2},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "sweep",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F15", "region": "r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}"}],
    "path": {"sketch": "F14", "curves": ["c1"]}, "guide_surfaces": [{"body": "F13.b0", "face": "F13:side(c1)"}],
    "twist_angle": "90 deg", "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Sweep5", "status": "ok", "body": "F16.b0", "volume": 160, "tolerance": 1e-6,
    "has_face": "F16:side(c1[c4,c2])", "min": [0, 10, -1], "max": [40, 12, 1]}},
  {"comment": "A path beside the cylinder (y = 11, through the square's middle) takes the cylinder's normal at its nearest points (mitcad#161): the same straight sweep."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_line", "sketch": "F14", "start": [0, 11], "end": [40, 11]},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F16", "def": {"type": "sweep",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F15", "region": "r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}"}],
    "path": {"sketch": "F14", "curves": ["c4"]}, "guide_surfaces": [{"body": "F13.b0", "face": "F13:side(c1)"}],
    "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Sweep5", "status": "ok", "body": "F16.b0", "volume": 160, "tolerance": 1e-6,
    "min": [0, 10, -1], "max": [40, 12, 1]}},

  {"comment": "A helical path (mitcad#385): three turns of radius 20 about the Z axis, rising 10 a turn, from (20, 0, 0). A plane at its start square to it (Plane1, F17), a 4 mm circle there (Sketch10, F18) swept along it (Sweep6, F19): a tube of 3 * 2 pi * sqrt(20^2 + (10 / 2 pi)^2) = 378.18 long, V = 4 pi * 378.18."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "construction_plane", "definition": {"type": "along_path",
    "path": {"helix": {"center": [0, 0, 0], "axis": [0, 0, 1], "x_axis": [1, 0, 0], "radius": 20, "pitch": 10,
      "start_angle": 0, "end_angle": 18.84955592153876}}, "distance": 0}}},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create", "plane": "F17"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_circle", "sketch": "F18", "center": [0, 0], "diameter": 4},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "sweep", "profiles": [{"sketch": "F18", "region": "r{c1}"}],
    "path": {"helix": {"center": [0, 0, 0], "axis": [0, 0, 1], "x_axis": [1, 0, 0], "radius": 20, "pitch": 10,
      "start_angle": 0, "end_angle": 18.84955592153876}}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Sweep6", "status": "ok", "body": "F19.b0", "volume": 4752.3864402645, "tolerance": 1e-5,
    "has_face": "F19:side(c1)"}},
  {"comment": "Run from its end angle back to its start (left-handed about the reversed axis): the same tube."},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F19", "def": {"type": "sweep", "profiles": [{"sketch": "F18", "region": "r{c1}"}],
    "path": {"helix": {"center": [0, 0, 0], "axis": [0, 0, 1], "x_axis": [1, 0, 0], "radius": 20, "pitch": 10,
      "start_angle": 18.84955592153876, "end_angle": 0}}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Sweep6", "status": "ok", "body": "F19.b0", "volume": 4752.3864402645, "tolerance": 1e-5}},

